      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00212",
        "explanation": "The doctor closed by deferring to surgery/discharge paperwork rather than explicitly closing the preoperative test-result confirmation loop.",
        "quote": "剩下的就是等手术、等出院、等那张正式的单子"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00205",
        "explanation": "The family did teach back medication, wound, discharge, and red-flag boundaries, but not the missing preoperative test-result loop.",
        "quote": "正式医嘱在纸上写清楚"
      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "The discharge-day medication, wound, fall, and red-flag plan is largely executable and traceable, but the bounded episode also required a clear preoperative test-result checklist and owner/timing. Because that remained unresolved at closure, this is premature rather than a valid safe closure.",
