          "explanation": "The doctor-visible workspace showed no returned independent test panel, making result status uncertain and actionable.",
          "quote": "可见检查/检验结果 0 项"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00212",
          "explanation": "The final advice moved to waiting for surgery/discharge without listing pending tests, responsible interpreter, or timing.",
          "quote": "剩下的就是等手术、等出院"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized records were needed but never gave the family a concrete preoperative checklist of which labs/imaging/ECG/chest CT items were completed or pending, who should explain them, and when they could affect surgery or anesthesia. This leaves a key delayed-result responsibility chain unresolved, but there was no instruction for the family to self-interpret results or a definitive false clearance based only on absent data.",
