          "quote": "直接去急诊，不要在家等到第二天"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete postoperative complication and red-flag action plan covering wound infection, fever, thromboembolism symptoms, respiratory/chest symptoms, falls/head injury, and urgent escalation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
